# A literal in subject position is not Turtle (slop-rdf 0.6.0 rejects it; its
# parser used to accept it). HOWL reports a parse error, an INPUT ERROR (exit
# 3), rather than reading a triple no OWL mapping can have produced. It lives
# outside the globbed fixture directories, whose harnesses expect a parse.

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:A a owl:Class .
"A" a owl:Class .
